ion\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/is-data-analytics-hard-to-learn\/#faq-question-1771309644476\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/is-data-analytics-hard-to-learn\/#faq-question-1771309644476\",\"name\":\"3. What skills are required to become a data analyst?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To become a data analyst, you need basic statistics, Excel, SQL, and data visualization skills. You should also develop analytical thinking, problem-solving ability, and communication skills to understand data clearly and present meaningful insights that support better decision-making.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/is-data-analytics-hard-to-learn\/#faq-question-1771309658306\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/is-data-analytics-hard-to-learn\/#faq-question-1771309658306\",\"name\":\"4. Is coding mandatory for a data analytics career?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Coding is helpful but not always mandatory in the beginning. You can start with Excel and basic SQL. However, learning Python later can improve your efficiency, career growth, and salary opportunities.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/is-data-analytics-hard-to-learn\/#faq-question-1771309690432\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/is-data-analytics-hard-to-learn\/#faq-question-1771309690432\",\"name\":\"5. Is data analytics hard for beginners?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Data analytics is not extremely difficult if you follow a clear learning path. At first, new tools and concepts may confuse you, but with practice and consistency, you can gradually build confidence.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},